<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="description" content="Find remarkable places to stay, from quiet mountain cabins to sunlit coastal homes. Your next somewhere starts with WanderLust."><meta name="theme-color" content="#e9e5d8"><title>WanderLust — Stay somewhere that stays with you</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link rel="preconnect" href="https://images.unsplash.com"><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/home.css?v=20261103-cinema">
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<% if (success.length || error.length) { %><div class="notices" role="status"><% [...success, ...error].forEach(message => { %><p><%= message %></p><% }); %></div><% } %>
<header class="site-header wrap"><a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="WanderLust home"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="20" cy="20" r="17"/><path d="m26 13-4 10-9 4 4-10z"/></svg><span>WanderLust</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="/listings">Stays</a><a href="#destinations">Places</a><a href="#journal">Journal</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="host-link" href="/listings/new">Become a host</a><a class="profile-link" href="<%= currUser ? '/profile' : '/login' %>"><%= currUser ? 'My profile' : 'Sign in' %><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero-image-parallax"><img class="hero-image" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525535-07fb3b4ae5f1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85" alt="A wooden boat crossing a clear mountain lake" width="2400" height="1600" fetchpriority="high"></div>
  <div class="hero-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-top wrap"><p class="hero-kicker"><span></span> A collection of places to belong</p><p class="hero-edition">INDEPENDENT STAYS · EST. FOR THE CURIOUS</p></div>
  <div class="hero-copy wrap"><p class="hero-intro">The world feels different<br>when you wake up somewhere new.</p><h1 id="hero-title"><span>Wander</span><span class="hero-title-second">Lust<span class="hero-period">.</span></span></h1>
    <div class="hero-bottom"><p>Find thoughtfully chosen homes, cabins and hideaways for the days you’ll remember.</p><form action="/listings" method="GET" role="search"><label for="hero-destination">Where are you dreaming of?</label><div class="hero-search"><input id="hero-destination" type="search" name="q" placeholder="A city, a coast, a feeling" maxlength="100"><button type="submit" aria-label="Explore stays"><span>Explore stays</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></button></div></form></div>
  </div><a class="scroll-cue" href="#intro"><span>Scroll to wander</span><i aria-hidden="true"></i></a><p class="hero-location">LAGO DI BRAIES · ITALIAN DOLOMITES</p>
</section>

<section class="intro-section wrap" id="intro" aria-labelledby="intro-title" data-reveal>
  <div class="intro-marker">01 <span>THE ART OF GETTING AWAY</span></div>
  <div class="intro-content"><h2 id="intro-title">Not just a place<br>to <em>stay.</em></h2><div class="intro-aside"><p>Somewhere that changes the pace. A door that opens onto a different kind of morning. A little more room for wonder.</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/listings">Find your somewhere <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div>
  <div class="intro-image-wrap"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1449158743715-0a90ebb6d2d8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=82" alt="A quiet wooden cabin tucked beneath tall forest trees" width="1400" height="900" loading="lazy"><span>THE QUIETER WAY THROUGH</span></div>
</section>

<section class="destinations" id="destinations" aria-labelledby="destinations-title">
 <div class="wrap"><div class="section-topline" data-reveal><p>02 / PLACES WITH A PULSE</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/listings">Explore all stays <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="destinations-heading" data-reveal><h2 id="destinations-title">A world of<br><em>somewheres.</em></h2><p>Four ways to feel a little further away.<br>Choose a place; let the rest unfold.</p></div>
  <% const destinations = [
    { name:'Bali', country:'Indonesia', note:'For the slow mornings', image:'photo-1537996194471-e657df975ab4', type:'Island life', className:'destination-bali' },
    { name:'Manali', country:'India', note:'For the open air', image:'photo-1464822759023-fed622ff2c3b', type:'Mountain time', className:'destination-manali' },
    { name:'Goa', country:'India', note:'For the salt in your hair', image:'photo-1512343879784-a960bf40e7f2', type:'Coastal days', className:'destination-goa' },
    { name:'Paris', country:'France', note:'For the lovely details', image:'photo-1502602898657-3e91760cbb34', type:'City wandering', className:'destination-paris' }
  ]; destinations.forEach((destination, index) => { %>
    <a class="destination-card <%= destination.className %>" href="/listings?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(destination.name) %>" data-reveal>
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/<%= destination.image %>?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1300&q=82" alt="Travel inspiration in <%= destination.name %>, <%= destination.country %>" width="1300" height="1600" loading="lazy"><span class="destination-wash" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="destination-index">0<%= index + 1 %> / <%= destination.type %></span><span class="destination-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span><span class="destination-copy"><span><%= destination.country %></span><h3><%= destination.name %></h3><p><%= destination.note %></p></span>
    </a>
  <% }); %>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="experiences wrap" id="experiences" aria-labelledby="experiences-title" data-reveal>
 <div class="experience-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518837695005-2083093ee35b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=82" alt="Ocean waves rolling onto a quiet shore at dusk" width="1500" height="1100" loading="lazy"><span>GO WHERE THE FEELING TAKES YOU</span></div>
 <div class="experience-copy"><p class="section-index">03 / CHOOSE YOUR OWN PACE</p><h2 id="experiences-title">A feeling<br>is a good<br><em>place to start.</em></h2><p>Follow a mood instead of a map. Find a cabin that slows the day, a coast that lets it drift, or a city that keeps you up a little longer.</p><div class="experience-links"><a href="/listings?category=Mountain"><span>01</span> Up in the mountains <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/listings?category=Beach"><span>02</span> Along the water <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/listings?category=City"><span>03</span> In the middle of it <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a><a href="/listings?category=Cabin"><span>04</span> Away from everything <b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></a></div></div>
</section>

<section class="manifesto" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title"><div class="wrap manifesto-inner" data-reveal><p class="section-index">04 / A SMALLER KIND OF GETAWAY</p><h2 id="manifesto-title">Less itinerary.<br>More <em>“remember when?”</em></h2><p class="manifesto-copy">A place to land, the freedom to look around, and the time to let a trip become your own. That’s the whole idea.</p><a class="button-light" href="/listings">Start exploring <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>

<section class="journal wrap" id="journal" aria-labelledby="journal-title">
 <div class="section-topline" data-reveal><p>05 / NOTES FROM THE ROAD</p><a class="arrow-link" href="/listings">Make your own story <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="journal-head" data-reveal><h2 id="journal-title">For the curious<br><em>and the almost-there.</em></h2><p>Little reminders that the best part of going<br>somewhere is what happens along the way.</p></div>
 <div class="journal-grid">
  <a class="journal-story journal-story-main" href="/listings?q=mountain" data-reveal><div class="journal-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1519681393784-d120267933ba?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=82" alt="Star-filled sky above a remote mountain range" width="1500" height="1100" loading="lazy"><span>FIELD NOTE Nº 01</span></div><div class="journal-meta"><span>TAKE THE LONG WAY</span><span>6 MIN READ</span></div><h3>Somewhere between the trail and the stars</h3><p>Find a little more sky, a little less signal, and a night that feels like it belongs to you.</p></a>
  <a class="journal-story journal-story-side" href="/listings?q=coast" data-reveal><div class="journal-image"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1473116763249-2faaef81ccda?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1100&q=82" alt="A winding path through a lush tropical landscape" width="1100" height="1250" loading="lazy"><span>FIELD NOTE Nº 02</span></div><div class="journal-meta"><span>FOLLOW THE LIGHT</span><span>4 MIN READ</span></div><h3>The beauty of having nowhere to be</h3><p>On open windows, late breakfasts, and days with no plans.</p></a>
 </div>
</section>

<section class="final-cta" aria-labelledby="final-title"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1470770841072-f978cf4d019e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85" alt="A cabin by a still alpine lake at the last light of day" width="2400" height="1200" loading="lazy"><div class="final-shade" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="final-copy wrap" data-reveal><p class="section-index">THE NEXT CHAPTER IS OUT THERE</p><h2 id="final-title">Go where you<br><em>feel most alive.</em></h2><a class="button-light" href="/listings">Find your stay <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><p class="final-caption">SOMEWHERE, ALPINE EUROPE · 46° 43′ N</p></section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="wrap footer-top"><a class="footer-wordmark" href="/">WanderLust<span>.</span></a><p>Find your somewhere.<br>Take the feeling with you.</p><div class="footer-links"><a href="/listings">Explore stays</a><a href="/listings/new">Become a host</a><a href="<%= currUser ? '/profile' : '/signup' %>"><%= currUser ? 'Your account' : 'Join WanderLust' %></a></div></div><div class="wrap footer-bottom"><span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> WanderLust. Made for the wonder in you.</span><a href="#main">Back to the beginning ↑</a></div></footer>
<script src="/js/images.js" defer></script><script src="/js/home.js?v=20261103-cinema" defer></script>
</body></html>
